    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova wahosheli naMosi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nindi, Yileji anyana kaIsarela akafumishi muchilombu akwambumba ejima niapwekaŋa ejima, nanajilolinamufu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mwekayifumishumu ni amayala niambanda, mwakayifumishi muchilombu akashakami kumpata, kulonda abuli kujilola chilombu chawu munashakamami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyana kaIsarela elili chochochu, ayifumishili muchilombu; mwahosheliyi Yehova naMosi dimu mweliluwu anyana kaIsarela.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova wahosheli naMosi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nindi, Hoshaku nawanyana kaIsarela neyi, Neyi kudi muntu hela hiiyala hela himumbanda, wukuvulumuna nshidi yavulumunaŋa antu, namotoki izu daYehova, owu muntu natanyi dehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aketeji mwanavulumunuwu, akafuti mwashikila muloŋa chikupu, akalunjikuku chibalu chamuchitanu, akamwinki owu adiyi nindi namuloŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwinza neyi kudi muntu wabula kawusoku windi akafutawu owu muloŋa, chuma chakamufutawu Yehova, chakekali chakapristu, akalunjiki hachizamba chakubuta, chochakamubutawu nachu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyilambu yejima yayumaya wanyana kaIsarela yajila yakuleleka yashikijaŋawu kudi kapristu yakekalaŋa yindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yajilikaŋawu nachu antu ejima yakekalaŋa yindi, yakamwinkaŋa wukapristu yejima yakekalaŋa yindi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova wahosheli naMosi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nindi, Hoshaku nawanyana kaIsarela, wuyili neyi, Neyi hadi iŋodamuntu nashiyi nfumwindi, namutamishi nfumwindi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nakami neyala wacheŋi namushimbi, nfumwindi kuchilukanehi, chinajindiki, najiloli dehi, kwosi chinsahu chakumushimunaku, kumukwata nachu nawa nehi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mukawu hiwukumuwana nfumwindi, hakumutiyila Iŋodindi mukawu, niyena mumbanda najiloli dehi; indi kwiji mukawu wunamuwani tuhu ŋana, hakutiyila Iŋodindi mukawu wakadikwindi kujilola; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iyala akashikiji Iŋodindi kudi kapristu, akamusendeli nihimulambu windi webaŋu dawuŋa wabali; bayi ahuŋunwinahu manjuku, hela kushahu nawa hbona nehi, muloŋa hihimulambu wawuŋa wamukawu, hihimulambu wawuŋa wakwanukisha nachu, wakwanukisha nachukuluwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kapristu akamushikŋi mumbanda kwakwihi, akamwimiki kumesu aYehova; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kapristu akanoneni meji mwinuriu yewumba, kapristu akanoninawa lunkuŋu lwahamaseki amutabanaka, akalwishi mumeji owu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kapristu akamwimiki mumbanda kumesu aYehova, akamukasununi mumbandansuki, akashi mumakasa anowu mumbanda owu himulambu wawuŋa wakwanukishanachu, diwu himulambu wawuŋa wamukawu; iku kapristu nakwatimuchikasa chindi owu meji akululisha aleteshaŋa ishiŋu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kapristu akamusanyikishi akamwili owu mumbanda, nindi, Neyi hiwunakami neyalaku, neyi hiwunashiyi nfumweyi hiwukuya nakujilolaku, wakapulukakumeji awa akululisha aleteshaŋa ishiŋu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwinza neyi wunashiyinfumweyi, wunajiloli, wunakami neyala wacheŋi hidiyi nfumweyuku; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "henohu kapristu akamusanyikishi mumbanda kusanyika kweshiŋu, kapristu akamwili mumbanda nindi, Yehova akushiŋi, wikali chishimashima mukachi kawakwenu, Yehova akuzemuni itafu deyi, akunanishi ivumu deyi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "awa meji eshiriu akukwijila munyijiriwa yeyi akananisha ivumu deyi, akazemuna itafu deyi. Mumbanda akeli nindi, Amena, Amena.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kapristu akasoneki mumukanda mashiŋu awa, akayijimi nameji akululisha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akamunwishi mumbanda owu meji akululisha aleteshaŋa shiŋu, owu meji aleteshaŋa ishiŋu akamwiŋila akalula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kapristu hakutambula muchikasa chamumbanda owu himulambu wawuŋa wamukawu, akawunyinkeshi kumesu aYehova, akawushikŋi kukameŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hahimulambu wawuŋa kapristu akazomonuhu wakwanukisha nachu, akawochi hakameŋa, nkumininaku hakumunwisha mumbanda owu meji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chakamunwishayi meji owu chakela neyi yena mumbanda najiloli, natamishi dehi nfumwindi, owu meji aleteshapa ishiŋu akamwiŋila akalula, niivumu dindi dakanana, niitafu dindi dakazemuka; owu mumbanda wakekala washiŋewa hakachikawa kwawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwinza neyi mumbanda hanajiloli kwinduku, watooka kwindi, wakapuluka kwindi, hakaba abaŋa nimavumu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lwenilu dilu lushimbi lwamukawu, lwakwila neyi mumbanda nashiyinfu mwindi najiloli; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.29",
